 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's a lovely idea. Do you want set up in the shade of a big tree, or in the open with a wind blanket? Sure. Not sure what. Want to ask in person and get an easy yes? Alright, stop me. Your neighbor invited you to a picnic, or you wanted to picnic on the roof, which would you like to ask about? That's a lovely idea. You could ask at dinner Saturday instead, so it' fresh in mind. Or you could ask after the hill picnic and offer to join, if they' open to new faces.",
